## Live probe evidence (this host)

### `oo_sys_exec` child env (`/usr/bin/env`)

Parent set: `LD_PRELOAD`, `BASH_ENV`, `ENV`, `IFS`, `DYLD_*`, `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`, `OODA_*`, `OO_*`, evil `PATH`.

Child observed:

```text
OODA_FS_WRITEDIR=/tmp
OODA_LEAK_TEST=1
OO_CUSTOM=1
PATH=/usr/bin:/bin
```

Classic loader/shell vars **absent**. Policy prefix vars **present**.

### `oo_dlopen`

```text
no ALLOW:     ffi residual: set OODA_FFI_ALLOW_DLOPEN=1 for OS dlopen
ALLOW only:   ffi residual: missing or invalid minisig   # libc unsigned
ALLOWDIR tmp: ffi residual: path not under OODA_FFI_ALLOWDIR
relative:     ffi residual: path not under system lib dirs
```

### `oo_write_file`

```text
unset WRITEDIR: deny
.. escape:      deny
symlink→outside: deny
new under dir:  allow (with WRITEDIR)
hardlink outside into dir: allow + overwrites outside  # BYPASS
```

